{"unit_id":"sh-222__dsh-recall#card-zh","repo":"sh-222/dsh-recall","commit":"272938a3fa729b26c15ee7beba13771155d6c863","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-recall 是 DeepSeek Harness 的上下文管理插件：它在工具执行后检查较旧且超过阈值的结果，把中间内容存入本地 SQLite，并在对话中保留开头、结尾和可供模型调用的 recall 标记。模型可按对象编号读取全文、指定字符范围或搜索匹配行；可配置 token 预算、保留的最新结果、存储保留上限。Web 界面还提供浮动统计面板，展示移出的结果、节省的 token、recall 次数和近期记录，适合经常处理大型工具输出的 DSH 用户。使用 Node SQLite 和本地状态目录，无需额外 API 服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:225-328","index.js:331-369","index.js:374-402","client.js:224-307"]}
{"unit_id":"sh-222__dsh-recall#card-en","repo":"sh-222/dsh-recall","commit":"272938a3fa729b26c15ee7beba13771155d6c863","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-recall moves the middle of oversized older tool results to local SQLite, keeping their head, tail, and a recall pointer inline. The model can fetch text by ID, range, or search. Settings control thresholds, budget, and retention. A web overlay summarizes saved tokens and recall activity.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:225-328","index.js:331-369","index.js:374-402","client.js:224-307"]}
